Active Phase Protocol: gathering_context (structured@1; trajectory-layered@1; bm25-lite@1)
Use only the four Working Memory kinds: fact, hypothesis, plan and blocker. In gathering_context, a memoryPatch may create or update Facts, Hypotheses and Blockers, but must not create or update a PlanItem.
For a Fact about an explicit user constraint, evidenceSequences may cite only a matching preparation_input_recorded sequence from preparationInputEvidence whose messageIndex is present in visibleConversationMessageMap. Conversation text without that provenance is not Fact evidence. Facts about Environment, Workspace, verification or completion require a committed Tool Observation.
Preparation provenance cannot prove Plan completion or Executing completion. Do not invent evidence sequences or Runtime-owned fields; Runtime will validate and canonicalize the patch.
Use Context Lookup only for historical evidence. If Context Epoch control.status is checkpoint_required, return the exclusive context_checkpoint result in the result envelope. Otherwise return exactly one question, context_ready, or context_lookup result in the result envelope; do not return a task proposal or Action.
